        <main property="mainContentOfPage" resource="#wb-main" typeof="WebPageElement" class="container">
            
            <div class="mwstitle section">

    <h1 property="name" id="wb-cont" dir="ltr">Water Survey of Canada</h1>
	</div>
<div class="mwscolumns section">

    <div class="row row">
        
            <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="mwsbodytext text parbase section">
    

    
        <p>The Water Survey of Canada (WSC) is the national authority responsible for the collection, interpretation and dissemination of standardized water resource data and information in Canada. In partnership with the provinces, territories and other agencies, <abbr title="Water Survey of Canada">WSC</abbr> operates over 2800 active hydrometric gauges across the country.</p>
<h2>Related links</h2>
<ul>
<li><a href="/en/environment-climate-change/services/water-overview/quantity/monitoring/survey/data-products-services.html">Water survey data products and services</a></li>
<li><a href="/en/environment-climate-change/services/water-overview/quantity/monitoring/survey/hydrometric-program-national-partnership.html">Hydrometric program: a national partnership</a></li>
<li><a href="/en/environment-climate-change/services/water-overview/quantity/monitoring/survey/partners-national-hydrometric-program.html">Partners of the national hydrometric program</a></li>
<li><a href="/en/environment-climate-change/services/water-overview/quantity/monitoring/survey/international-activities.html">Water Survey of Canada: international activities</a></li>
<li><a href="/en/environment-climate-change/services/water-overview/quantity/monitoring/survey/hydrology.html">Hydrology of Canada</a></li>
<li><a href="/en/environment-climate-change/services/water-overview/quantity/monitoring/survey/contact.html">Contact Water Survey of Canada</a></li>
<li><a href="/en/environment-climate-change/services/water-overview/quantity/monitoring/survey/provincial-territorial-flood-information.html">Water survey of Canada and provincial/territorial flood information</a></li>
</ul>

    


</div>


            </div>
        
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="mwspanel section">




    

    

    <section class="panel panel-primary">
        <header class="panel-heading">
            <h5 class="panel-title">Highlights</h5>
        </header>

        <div class="panel-body">
            <div class="mwsbodytext text parbase section">
    

    
        <ul>
<li><a href="https://wateroffice.ec.gc.ca/search/real_time_e.html">Real-time Hydrometric Data</a></li>
<li><a href="https://wateroffice.ec.gc.ca/search/historical_e.html">Archived Hydrometric Data Online</a></li>
<li>Find links to the <a href="/en/environment-climate-change/services/water-overview/quantity/monitoring/survey/provincial-territorial-flood-information.html">flood information</a> available across the country.</li>
</ul>

    


</div>


